{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y压缩了部分心理因果，尤其S09对方仍然亲近这一现实依据，以及S13从害怕添负担转向害怕失去的心理变化，X交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句和【】高亮让普通观众很快抓住每段心理落点，感受词较小且部分随乐句出现，降低了一次性扫读的压力。它对水波、船身、摇荡、歌声、浪潮等音乐意象的反复呼应，也让情绪变化具有连续性，感受更具体、更有层次。X的心理因果交代更充分，但长句需要观众投入更多阅读注意力，容易与听音乐争夺注意力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fff79159-d58f-4f3e-9f78-8ffebda83d39", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T224945357735Z", "elapsed_seconds": 72.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:50:57.666766+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "33b8afcb34f88e5f8af6e42e2c6d6d5ae3bc2be8ca57e76016013ded7136f490", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2